{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>Blessed be Asher above sons.</b> Asher will here be blessed more than all the other tribes, for although every wealthy tribe arouses the envy and hatred of its brothers to some degree, the opposite will happen to the tribe of Asher, for he will be accepted by his brothers." "<b>And he dips his foot in oil.</b> This is because he would set oil among his brothers to bathe in, on account of the abundance of oil he possessed."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:40.299727908Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}